  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project Description: Equity investment in Negocios Regionales Fondo de Inversi&#xf3;n Privado for an amount not to exceed US$4 million. Negocios Regionales is a private investment fund, duly established in accordance with the Chilean law. The fund will invest in small and medium size enterprises established in Chile in areas other than the metropolitan area of Santiago. The term of the fund is 10 years.</narrative>
